<p>This tutorial illustrates how to create <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Items%20with%20codex%20entries%20tutorial" title="Items with codex entries tutorial (page does not exist)">items with codex entries</a> for both a new standalone module or an extension to the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Single%20Player%20Campaign" title="Single Player Campaign (page does not exist)">Single Player Campaign</a>. Additionally it will show you how to destroy, or avoid destroying, the item once the codex entry has been created.
</p>
